# ==============================================================================
# GAMING SOLUTIONS - SUITE DE PRUEBAS DE API PARA REST CLIENT (VS CODE)
# Extensión: REST Client (Huachao Mao)
# Para ejecutar una petición, haz clic en "Send Request" arriba de cada bloque.
# ==============================================================================

### Variables Globales de Entorno
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@ordsBaseUrl = https://oracleapex.com/ords/willi_gs/gaming
@userAgent = Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64)


# ==============================================================================
# 1. SERVIDOR NODE.JS LOCAL (http://localhost:3000)
# Recomendo usar estos endpoints porque Node.js maneja la conexión interna
# con Oracle Cloud de forma segura evitando bloqueos WAF/Akamai.
# ==============================================================================

### 1.1 Estado de Salud de la API
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

### 1.2 Métricas Principales del Dashboard
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/dashboard
Accept: application/json

### 1.3 Consultar Inventario Completo
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/inventory
Accept: application/json

### 1.4 Consultar Catálogos Auxiliares (Clientes, Proveedores y Productos)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/catalogs
Accept: application/json

### 1.5 Crear Producto con Certificado #GS (Next-Gen, Laptop o Retro)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/inventory
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "PlayStation 5 Pro 2TB",
  "brand": "Sony",
  "model": "CFI-7000",
  "type": "NEXT_GEN",
  "price": 699.99,
  "cost": 580.00,
  "stock": 4
}

### 1.6 Crear Laptop Gamer con Pruebas de Estrés
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/inventory
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Laptop Lenovo Legion Pro 5",
  "brand": "Lenovo",
  "model": "16IRX8",
  "type": "LAPTOP",
  "price": 1399.99,
  "cost": 1100.00,
  "stock": 3
}

### 1.7 Actualizar Precio y Stock de un Producto (ej. ID 1)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/inventory/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "price": 489.99,
  "stock": 10
}

### 1.8 Registrar Venta en Efectivo / Transferencia
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sales
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": 1,
  "payment": "EFECTIVO",
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": 1,
      "quantity": 1,
      "price": 499.99
    }
  ]
}

### 1.9 Registrar Compra a Proveedor (Reabastecimiento)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/purchases
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "providerId": 1,
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": 2,
      "quantity": 3,
      "cost": 290.00
    }
  ]
}


# ==============================================================================
# 2. ORACLE APEX DIRECTO (ORDS REST Data Services)
# Nota: Si el WAF (Akamai) de oracleapex.com bloquea POST directo,
# asegúrate de usar HTTPS e incluir el header User-Agent.
# ==============================================================================

### 2.1 ORDS: Consultar Inventario Certificado #GS en Oracle Cloud (GET funciona directo)
GET {{ordsBaseUrl}}/productos/
Accept: application/json
User-Agent: {{userAgent}}

### 2.2 ORDS: Crear Producto e Inspección Técnica en Oracle APEX (POST)
POST {{ordsBaseUrl}}/productos/
Content-Type: application/json
User-Agent: {{userAgent}}

{
  "name": "Super hola  SNES Recapacitada GS",
  "brand": "Nintendo",
  "model": "SNS-009",
  "type": "RETRO",
  "price": 10.00,
  "cost": 1.00,
  "stock": 200,
  "description": "Recapacitado con SMD Nichicon y blanqueado UV",
  "hw_pct": 100,
  "aesthetic_pct": 94,
  "thermal_pct": 98
}

### 2.3 ORDS: Consultar Métricas Consolidadas del Dashboard
GET {{ordsBaseUrl}}/dashboard/
Accept: application/json
User-Agent: {{userAgent}}

### 2.4 ORDS: Consultar Lista de Clientes
GET {{ordsBaseUrl}}/catalogos/
Accept: application/json
User-Agent: {{userAgent}}

### 2.5 ORDS: Registrar Venta Directa en Oracle APEX (POST)
POST {{ordsBaseUrl}}/ventas/
Content-Type: application/json
User-Agent: {{userAgent}}

{
  "customerId": 1,
  "payment": "TRANSFERENCIA",
  "total": 349.99,
  "productId": 2,
  "quantity": 1,
  "price": 349.99,
  "notes": "Venta procesada mediante REST Client"
}
